[{"title":"馀杭久旱赵悦道入境之夕四郊雨足二首 其二","author":"曾巩","text":"旌旗东下路尘开，六月风云席上回。\n正恐一方人暍死，直将霖雨过江来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":13,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"馀杭久旱赵悦道入境之夕四郊雨足二首 其一","author":"曾巩","text":"连章天上乞身闲，笑入吴船拥节还。\n一夜风雷驱旱魃，始知霖雨出人间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":14,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杜鹃","author":"曾巩","text":"杜鹃花上杜鹃啼，自有归心似见机。\n人各有求难意合，何须勤苦劝人归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芙蓉桥","author":"曾巩","text":"雁翅横连杜若洲，碧阑干影在中流。\n蓬莱日日游人到，谁道仙风解引舟？","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闰正月十一日吕殿丞寄新茶","author":"曾巩","text":"偏得朝阳借力催，千金一胯过溪来。\n曾坑贡后春犹早，海上先尝第一杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":17,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和赵宫保别杭州","author":"曾巩","text":"紞鼓留公岂是催，湖山得意且徘徊。\n更应准拟须乘兴，范蠡扁舟去却来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":18,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏柳","author":"曾巩","text":"乱条犹未变初黄，倚得东风势便狂。\n解把飞花蒙日月，不知天地有清霜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":19,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜出过利涉门","author":"曾巩","text":"红纱笼烛照斜桥，复观翚飞入斗杓。\n人在画船犹未睡，满堤明月一溪潮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜出城南祷雨","author":"曾巩","text":"海天重叠四山云，半出星辰亦半昏。\n上得篮舆是中夜，两街灯照九重门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":21,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉和滁州九咏九首并序 其四 琅琊溪","author":"曾巩","text":"野草山花夹乱流，桥边旌旆影悠悠。\n即应要地无人见，可忍开时不出游？","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉和滁州九咏九首并序 其五 班春亭","author":"曾巩","text":"山亭尝自绝浮埃，山路辉光五马来。\n春满人间不知主，谁言炉冶此中开？","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":23,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉和滁州九咏九首并序 其八 慧觉方丈","author":"曾巩","text":"七言老意苍松蟠，百金古字青霞镌。\n儒林孟子先生是，墨者夷之后代传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":24,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨后环波亭次韵四首 其一 次李秀才得鱼字韵","author":"曾巩","text":"候月已知星好雨，卜年方喜梦维鱼。\n从今拨置庭中事，最喜西轩睡枕书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":25,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨后环波亭次韵四首 其四 次综得花字韵","author":"曾巩","text":"丹杏一番收美实，绿荷无数放新花。\n西湖雨后清心目，坐到城头泊暝鸦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":26,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨后环波亭次韵四首 其二 次绾得风字韵","author":"曾巩","text":"荷芰东西鱼映叶，樵舟朝暮客乘风。\n清泉雨后分毛发，何必南湖是镜中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":27,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"亲旧书报京师盛闻治声","author":"曾巩","text":"自知孤宦无材术，谁道京师有政声。\n默坐海边何计是？\n白头亲在凤凰城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":28,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"垓下","author":"曾巩","text":"三杰同归汉道兴，拔山馀力尔徒矜。\n泫然垓下真儿女，不悟当从一范增。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"城南二首 其二","author":"曾巩","text":"水满横塘雨过时，一番红景杂花飞。\n送春无限情惆怅，身在天涯未得归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":30,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"城南二首 其一","author":"曾巩","text":"雨过横塘水满堤，乱山高下路东西。\n一番桃李花开尽，惟有青青草色齐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":31,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"尝新茶","author":"曾巩","text":"麦粒收来品绝伦，葵花制出样争新。\n一杯永日醒双眼，草木英华信有神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":32,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荔枝四首 其四","author":"曾巩","text":"金钗双捧玉纤纤，星宿光芒动宝奁。\n解笑诗人誇博物，祇知红颗味酸甜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":33,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荔枝四首 其三","author":"曾巩","text":"绛縠囊收白露团，未曾封值向长安。\n昭阳殿里才闻得，已道佳人不奈寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":34,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荔枝四首 其二","author":"曾巩","text":"玉润冰清不受尘，仙衣裁剪绛纱新。\n千门万户谁曾得？\n只有昭阳第一人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":35,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荔枝四首 其一","author":"曾巩","text":"剖见隋珠醉眼开，丹砂缘手落尘埃。\n谁能有力如黄犊？\n摘尽繁星始下来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":36,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"席上","author":"曾巩","text":"市井萧条烟火微，两衙散后雪深时。\n若无一曲传金盏，争奈衰翁两鬓丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":37,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"恩藏主送古梅求诗","author":"曾巩","text":"折得前村雪里枝，殷勤来聘老夫诗。\n请公静看横斜影，便是当年一字师。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":38,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游麻姑山九首 其二 桃花源","author":"曾巩","text":"来时秋不见桃花，空树寒泉泻石涯。\n争得时人见鸾凤，不教身去忆烟霞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"离齐州后五首 其五","author":"曾巩","text":"荷气夜凉生枕席，水声秋醉入帘帏。\n一帆千里空回首，寂寞船窗祇自知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":40,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"离齐州后五首 其四","author":"曾巩","text":"将家须向习池游，难放西湖十顷秋。\n从此七桥风与月，梦魂长到木兰舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":41,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"离齐州后五首 其三","author":"曾巩","text":"文犀剡剡穿林笋，翠靥田田出水荷。\n正是西亭销暑日，却将离恨寄烟波。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"离齐州后五首 其二","author":"曾巩","text":"画船终日扒沙行，已去齐州一月程。\n千里相随是明月，水西亭上一般明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":43,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"离齐州后五首 其一","author":"曾巩","text":"云帆十幅顺风行，卧听随船白浪声。\n好在西湖波上月，酒醒还到纸窗明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄齐州同官","author":"曾巩","text":"西湖一曲舞霓裳，劝客花前白玉觞。\n谁对七桥今夜月？\n有情千里不相忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄献新茶","author":"曾巩","text":"种处地灵偏得日，摘时春早未闻雷。\n京师万里争先到，应得慈亲手自开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":46,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒食","author":"曾巩","text":"一麾飘泊在天涯，寒食园林不见花。\n唯有市亭酤酒客，俚歌声到日西斜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"疏山","author":"曾巩","text":"一见云山病眼清，野僧勤动水边迎。\n苍松翠竹东南道，乱石峰前踏月行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鲍山","author":"曾巩","text":"云中一点鲍山青，东望能令两眼明。\n若道人心是矛戟，山前那得叔牙城？","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":49,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹤林寺","author":"曾巩","text":"昔人春尽强登山，只肯逢僧半日闲。\n何似一尊乘兴去，醉中骑马月中还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":50,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠弹琴者","author":"曾巩","text":"至音淡薄谁曾赏，古意飘零自可怜。\n不似秦筝能合意，满堂倾耳十三弦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":51,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霿凇","author":"曾巩","text":"园林初日静无风，霿凇开花处处同。\n记得集英深殿里，舞人齐插玉笼?。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":52,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丁元珍挽词二首 其二","author":"曾巩","text":"从军王粲笔，记礼后苍篇。\n谩有残书在，能令好事传。\n鹏来悲四月，鹤去遂千年。\n试想长桥路，昏昏陇隧烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":53,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丁元珍挽词二首 其一","author":"曾巩","text":"翰墨金声远，神情玉气温。\n节廉贫愈见，风义老弥惇。\n旧学资详正，新仪属讨论。\n谁怜一麾出，终不反修门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":54,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刁景纯挽歌词二章 其二","author":"曾巩","text":"八十登高步更轻，殷勤爱客是平生。\n能临缓急敦风谊，不向炎凉逐世情。\n北岳云烟思抗志，东门冠盖羡遗荣。\n可怜昨日壶觞地，呜咽唯闻薤露声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":55,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刁景纯挽歌词二章 其一","author":"曾巩","text":"史观郎闱得谢归，桓桓筋力未全衰。\n园林笑傲笙歌拥，山水追寻几杖随。\n尺牍百封虚有意，文章十帙更传谁？\n余花自出藏春坞，一点青灯照穗帷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上巳日瑞圣园锡燕呈诸同舍","author":"曾巩","text":"北上郊原一据鞭，华林清集缀儒冠。\n方塘渰渰春先渌，密竹娟娟午更寒。\n流渚酒浮金凿落，照庭花并玉阑干。\n君恩倍觉丘山重，长日从容笑语欢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上元","author":"曾巩","text":"金鞍驰骋属儿曹，夜半喧阗意气豪。\n明月满街流水远，华灯入望众星高。\n风吹玉漏穿花急，人近朱阑送目劳。\n自笑低心逐年少，只寻前事撚霜毛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":58,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上杜相三首 其三","author":"曾巩","text":"转觉忧馀好尚孤，较量唯合老葭蒲。\n圣贤可是随时拙，正直由来济世迂。\n生事有亲甘钓筑，客情无力买山湖。\n天边愁绝伤离苦，台象空看照宋都。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":59,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上杜相三首 其二","author":"曾巩","text":"翊戴唐虞旦暮中，忽将符节抚山东。\n忆归慷慨无私计，抗疏频烦有古风。\n世路一人知进退，士林当日计穷通。\n寿觞须祝年年喜，旧德华夷望更隆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":60,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上杜相三首 其一","author":"曾巩","text":"天扶昌代得忠良，坐以材谋镇庙堂。\n万里声名开学校，四方根本劝农桑。\n从容贤路通江海，慷慨公心贯雪霜。\n谦让黑辕归太早，空令终古爱馀芳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":61,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上杜相公","author":"曾巩","text":"水为舟楫旱为霖，社稷生民注意深。\n岂谓便辞黄阁议，翻然求就紫芝吟。\n始终好古儒林士，进退忧时国老心。\n只有声名随日远，不令功被管弦音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":62,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书阁","author":"曾巩","text":"自怜野性生来拙，谁许交情晚最亲？\n世路因仍忧槛阱，他乡衰暮傍风尘。\n惟将菽藿还求志，未有丝毫可为人。\n一亩萧然须暂得，欲偷闲日长精神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":63,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仁宗皇帝挽词三首 其三","author":"曾巩","text":"沧海难回日，青云如送春。\n服丧三月遍，遏乐四夷均。\n感格英灵在，褒扬大号新。\n依然社稷计，王业付真人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仁宗皇帝挽词三首 其二","author":"曾巩","text":"日转归人外，天移入画中。\n冕旒馀泽在，惊跸旧仪空。\n卜宅三川绕，方丧万里通。\n初寒石门路，松桧飒悲风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":65,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仁宗皇帝挽词三首 其一","author":"曾巩","text":"纳谏终无牾，知人久更明。\n恩波通四海，寿域载群生。\n异俗衣裳会，诸儒雅颂声。\n威灵空想象，盛德讵能名？","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":66,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以白山茶寄吴仲庶见贶佳篇依韵和酬","author":"曾巩","text":"山茶纯白是天真，筠笼封题摘尚新。\n秀色未饶三谷雪，清香先得五峰春。\n琼花散漫情终荡，玉蕊萧条迹更尘。\n远寄一枝随驿使，欲分芳种恨无因。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":67,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元沙院","author":"曾巩","text":"升山南下一峰高，上尽层轩未厌劳。\n际海烟云常惨淡，大寒松竹更萧骚。\n经台日永销香篆，谈席风生落麈毛。\n我亦有心从自得，琉璃瓶水照秋毫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":68,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凤池寺","author":"曾巩","text":"经年闻说凤池山，蜡屐方偷半日闲。\n笑语客随朱阁上，醉醒身在白云间。\n溪桥野水清犹急，海岸轻寒去却还。\n为郡天涯亦潇洒，莫嗟流落鬓毛斑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":69,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"升山灵岩寺","author":"曾巩","text":"修竹长松十里阴，任敦烧药洞门深。\n独窥金版惊人语，能到青霞出世心。\n鸡犬亦随云外去，蓬瀛何必海中寻。\n丹楼碧阁唐朝寺，钟呗香花满旧林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":70,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水香亭","author":"曾巩","text":"临池飞构郁岧峣，棂槛无风影自摇。\n群玉过林抽翠竹，双虹垂岸跨平桥。\n烦依美藻鱼争饵，清见寒沙水满桡。\n莫问荷花开几曲，但知行处异香飘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":71,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王虞部惠佳篇叙述昔与湘潭亡弟游从仍以亡弟旧诗见示","author":"曾巩","text":"薄宦红尘常拂面，早衰黄发已盈颠。\n棣华零落曾谁语？\n鸿羽萧条祇自怜。\n已矣空闻怀旧赋，泫然犹获济江篇。\n殷勤慰我如君少，更悟之他友最贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":72,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬夜即事","author":"曾巩","text":"印奁封罢阁铃闲，喜有秋毫免素餐。\n市粟易求仓廪实，邑狵无警里闾安。\n香清一榻氍毹暖，月淡千门霿凇寒。\n闻说丰年从此始，更回笼烛卷帘看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":73,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"北池小会","author":"曾巩","text":"笑语从容酒慢巡，笙歌随赏北池春。\n波间镂槛花迷眼，沙际朱桥柳拂人。\n金缕暗移泉溜急，银簧相合鸟声新。\n幸时无事须行乐，物外乾坤一点尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":74,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"圣贤","author":"曾巩","text":"圣贤性分良难并，好恶情怀岂得同。\n荀子书犹非孟子，召公心未悦周公。\n况令树立追高远，而使裁量属闇蒙。\n举世不知何足怪，力行无顾是豪雄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":75,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"圣泉寺","author":"曾巩","text":"笑问并儿一举鞭，亦逢佳景暂留连。\n青冥日抱山腰阁，碧野云含石眼泉。\n蹑屐路通林北寺，落帆门系海东船。\n闽王旧事今何在？\n惟有村村供佛田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":76,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"正月十一日迎驾呈诸同舍","author":"曾巩","text":"锦袍周卫一番新，警跸朝严下紫宸。\n俗眼望来犹眩日，天颜回处自生春。\n行齐鹓鹭常随仗，步稳骅骝不起尘。\n归路青云喧鼓吹，乐游从此属都人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":77,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"甘露寺多景楼","author":"曾巩","text":"欲收嘉景此楼中，徙倚阑干四望通。\n云乱水光浮紫翠，天含山气入青红。\n一川钟呗淮南月，万里帆樯海外风。\n老去衣衿尘土在，祇将心目羡冥鸿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":78,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"田中作","author":"曾巩","text":"傍人应总笑为生，病体朝朝踏雨行。\n红饭白菹妻具饷，青秧绿水自催耕。\n止知索寞箪瓢计，岂论喧哗内素名。\n胜事山风吹木石，暂如韶夏管弦声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":79,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石门","author":"曾巩","text":"细草疏云一径凉，纵吟閒望兴何长。\n僧关入竹行随意，野茹持钱得满筐。\n江腹远吞千壑翠，峡门高控两崖苍。\n乘秋更欲西山雨，一洗郊原晚稻香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":80,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再赋喜雪","author":"曾巩","text":"六花飞舞势蹁跹，点缀寒林态更妍。\n山险龙蛇盘鸟道，野平江海变畬田。\n人狂奔月非关夜，马健乘云别有天。\n况值白羊新酒熟，可能相就庆丰年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":81,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"华不注山","author":"曾巩","text":"虎牙千仞立巉巉，峻拔遥临济水南。\n翠岭嫩岚晴可掇，金舆陈迹久谁探。\n高标特起青云近，壮士三周战气酣。\n丑父遗忠无处问，空馀一掬野泉甘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":82,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孙少述示近诗兼仰高致","author":"曾巩","text":"大句闳篇久擅场，一函初得胜琳琅。\n少陵雅健材孤出，彭泽清闲兴最长。\n世外麒麟谁可系？\n云中鸿雁本高翔。\n白头多病襄阳守，展卷临风欲自强。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":83,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏书","author":"曾巩","text":"集贤自笑文章少，为郡谁言乐事多。\n报答书题亲笔砚，逢迎使客听笙歌。\n一心了了无人语，两鬓萧萧奈老何。\n还有不随流俗处，秋毫无累损天和。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":84,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]